Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Cho phep trang fcim (http://fcim.mkvision.com:3000 va https://fcim.mkvision.com) goi Kanban relay
; trong mang noi bo (172.22.7.84:8765) ma khong bi Chrome/Edge chan hay hoi quyen "Truy cap mang cuc bo".
; Khong co chinh sach nay: Kanban quay ve tu hoi server moi 5 giay.
; Cach dung: chay file nay bang quyen Administrator tren tung may xuong, dong het Chrome/Edge roi mo lai.
; Kiem tra: mo chrome://policy (hoac edge://policy) thay cac muc ben duoi o trang thai OK.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\InsecurePrivateNetworkRequestsAllowedForUrls]
"1"="http://fcim.mkvision.com:3000"
"2"="https://fcim.mkvision.com"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls]
"1"="http://fcim.mkvision.com:3000"
"2"="https://fcim.mkvision.com"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\InsecurePrivateNetworkRequestsAllowedForUrls]
"1"="http://fcim.mkvision.com:3000"
"2"="https://fcim.mkvision.com"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls]
"1"="http://fcim.mkvision.com:3000"
"2"="https://fcim.mkvision.com"
